---
<section class="on-dark bg-ink">
  <div class="wrap py-16 lg:py-[120px]">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,620px)_minmax(0,440px)] lg:justify-between lg:gap-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <p class="font-display text-[clamp(88px,29vw,168px)] font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-[-5px] text-white lg:text-[clamp(120px,11.67vw,168px)]" aria-label="9:58 PM">9:58 PM</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
          <div class="rounded-ui bg-ink-raised px-4 py-3 text-[17px] leading-[1.4] text-white">Can I move my Thursday appointment to Friday?</div>
          <span class="text-[14px] font-semibold leading-[1.3] text-danger-on-dark">No reply</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
          <span class="text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-on-dark-faint">7:05 AM</span>
          <span class="text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.4] text-white">Never mind, I’ve booked somewhere else.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
        <h2 class="h2 !text-white">After closing time, the questions keep coming.</h2>
        <p class="max-w-[420px] text-[17px] leading-[1.6] text-on-dark-muted">Most small businesses reply the next morning. By then, some of those customers have already booked with whoever answered first. AI Front Desk answers them while you’re closed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
